进小型测试项目的方案设计、落地执行与结论输出，并有可复用的方法论沉淀案例。","Require":"1. 本科及以上学历，3年以上抖音本地生活直播运营经验，了解本地推投放逻辑；有租车、出行、本地服务或高客单虚拟卡券类目经验者优先；\n2. 具备数据驱动的问题定位与优化能力：能基于GPM、UV价值、转化率、停留时长、核销率等指标定位问题，输出可落地优化方案，并有通过调优提升核心指标的可量化案例；\n3. 有从0到1起号或新类目冷启动经验：能在2周内独立完成竞品调研、脚本框架搭建和首播测试；或具备从1到10规模化运营经验，能优化现有直播间效率并突破增长瓶颈；\n4. 有完整的直播项目复盘经验，能形成标准化SOP并沉淀可复用方法论，有输出策略简报或测试报告的习惯；\n5. 对所负责直播间的GMV、ROI、核销率等核心指标有明确承诺，能主动同步风险并给出备选方案；有跨团队（投放、商品、客服、合规等）协作推动项目落地的具体案例。\n加分项\n● 有从0到1搭建本地生活直播间/账号并跑通盈利模型的经验；\n● 有本地生活出行商家、头部商家或知名IP的直播操盘案例；有抖音电商、视频号等直播经验\n● 有使用AI工具提升运营效率的实践经验。","ClassificationOne":"线上运营","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科","YearsOfWorking":"3年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-09-30T17:57:57","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"f35473c2-cb34-476b-98df-60d15a65b77e","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":511216531,"PostDateInt":1790661957000,"PostDate":"202